Since April, people have told us their bookings land on the wrong day: a month flipped. By
4 October the desk had **412 reports**.

They were merged as one issue. That was wrong. The export shows **two** causes:
**`parser` (379 reports)** and **`hint` (33 reports)**.

<Callout>
#4471 closed 05 Oct. parser FIXED (`fix(dates): parse dd/mm for eu locales`).
hint WON'T FIX (booking-v3 form retired).
</Callout>

## What was merged

<CauseTable ticket={4471} />

## Since April

<QueueTimeline ticket={4471} />

## Lessons

- Subject-only dedupe can merge two bugs into one ticket.
- Split by cause before you mark known.

